      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/30/1/1/40",
      "text": [
        " أبو عبد الله (ع) يا ثابتُ، إنّ الله إذا أحّبّ عبداً غثّه بالبلاء غثّاً وثَجّه به ثَجّاً، وأنا وإيّاكم لنُصبح به ونمسي."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.muhajir-b-ali": [
          "40. It has been narrated that Abu Hamzah said that Abu 'Abd Allah (a.s) said: O Thabit! When Allah loves a person, He pours afflictions on him and rains them heavily on him. And (all the while) we pass our days and nights with him (unaware of his suffering)."
        ]
      }
    },
